NexusMind was developed with reference to open-source software, academic
research, and public technical ecosystems. The project acknowledges MiroFish
for its open-source inspiration and reference value. NexusMind reorganizes its
system goals and engineering implementation for university and public-opinion
events, with a focus on a paper-based Social World Model, incremental material
ingestion, rolling forecasting, decision briefs, interactive analysis, and
closed-loop decision support.

